<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Event FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can I limit who sees each event?</h3>
    <p>Yes — events are scoped to teams. A small-group meeting only shows to that team; an all-hands competition shows to the whole org.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">How does time tracking work?</h3>
    <p>Use the kiosk at your shop or meeting space. Members clock in/out with PIN, barcode, or RFID; managers can bulk clock-out a whole period at once. Reports roll up by period.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Will my calendar sync to Google Calendar?</h3>
    <p>Not yet — calendar display sync is on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a> as a confident next, not a hidden gap. The internal calendar already supports RSVPs and shifts today.</p>
